<title>CHINA: China January corn imports down 100 pct.</title>
<headline>China January corn imports down 100 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's corn imports were zero in January, compared with imports of 280,000 tonnes in the year-ago month, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China imported 440,000 tonnes of corn in 1996, down 91.4 percent from the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>China exported 20,000 tonnes of corn in January, the figures showed. China exported no corn in January last year.</p>
<p>China exported 160,000 tonnes of corn in 1996, up 40.9 percent from the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
